t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Under President Donald J. Trump’s leadership, the Administration has delivered historic results for the American people in just 21 months through executive action alone. The promise of America has been quickly reignited under the President’s common-sense leadership, making America the hottest nation in the world and reviving the American Dream. Crime has plummeted, merit is restored, burdensome red tape is gone, and American energy is unleashed.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">President Trump will never stop delivering on his promises to Make America Great Again. Time and time again, he has defied the naysayers, achieving what they deem as impossible to deliver results that improve the lives of the American people.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Exercising his executive authority, the President has:&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Executed a record-setting 147 Executive Orders</strong> in his first 100 days—more than any other President in history—and over 290 Executive Orders since January 2025, delivering on his promises of a more prosperous and secure America. </li>\n\n\n\n<li>Delivered the most secure border in history, <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/how-president-trump-ended-the-border-invasion-and-restored-american-sovereignty/\"><strong>enforcing</strong></a><strong> an extraordinary crackdown on illegal immigration</strong>, <a href=\"https://www.brookings.edu/articles/macroeconomic-implications-of-immigration-flows-in-2025-and-2026-january-2026-update/\">resulting</a> in negative net migration to the U.S. for the first time in over half a century. <ul><li><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/how-president-trump-ended-the-border-invasion-and-restored-american-sovereignty/\">Terminated</a> welfare for illegal aliens across government programs, including <a href=\"https://thehill.com/homenews/administration/5745544-hud-bars-undocumented-immigrants/\">public housing</a> benefits, <a href=\"https://www.usda.gov/about-usda/news/press-releases/2025/07/10/secretary-rollins-prevents-illegal-aliens-receiving-taxpayer-funded-snap-benefits\">food stamps</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.sba.gov/article/2026/03/09/sba-bans-foreign-nationals-accessing-sba-backed-loans\">small business loans</a>. American taxpayer benefits are for Americans only, not illegal aliens.<a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2026/09/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-further-enhances-program-integrity-and-interagency-coordination-in-the-h-1b-visa-program/\">Strengthened</a> H-1B enforcement to protect the jobs of hardworking Americans and prevent visa abuse.  </li></ul>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Ensured Americans are the <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/president-trump-delivers-largest-drop-in-violent-crime-in-american-history/\">safest</a> they’ve been in years by removing the worst of the worst and deporting millions of criminal illegal aliens from our streets. </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/president-trump-delivers-largest-drop-in-violent-crime-in-american-history/\"><strong>Delivered</strong></a><strong> the largest drop in violent crime in American history </strong>in 2025, and preliminary 2026 data <a href=\"https://cde.ucr.cjis.gov/LATEST/resources/reports/UCR_Summary_of_Reported_Crimes_in_the_Nation_2025.pdf#page=4\">shows</a> it is falling even further. <ul><li>In one year, violent crime saw its largest decline in history; murders fell over 18% to the lowest rate ever seen, and robberies fell more than 18%.</li></ul><ul><li>Property crimes, rapes, and aggravated assaults all <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/president-trump-delivers-largest-drop-in-violent-crime-in-american-history/\">dropped</a> as well in 2025.</li></ul>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.foxnews.com/politics/kash-patel-reveals-fbi-capture-all-10-members-most-wanted-fugitive-list-during-hearing\">Captured</a> all of the FBI’s Ten Most Wanted fugitives — 2.5 times as many as the entire previous four-year Administration — and six of the FBI’s Most Wanted Fraudsters.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fraud/\">Cracked down</a> on<strong> fraud, waste, and corruption across the federal government at an unprecedented rate</strong>, and restored integrity to federal programs designed to help Americans in need.<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fraud/\">Uncovered</a> more than $260 billion in fraud of taxpayer dollars and <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fraud/\">stopped</a> $72 billion a year, breaking up large-scale fraud schemes and seeing through that fraudsters are brought to justice.</li></ul>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The Trump Administration has stopped fraudulent payments before they go out the door, detected high-risk fraud trends, and shut down suspected fraudulent providers and retailers.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2026/10/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-ended-the-illegal-and-discriminatory-practices-of-diversity-equity-and-inclusion/\"><strong>Ended</strong></a><strong> illegal and discriminatory diversity, equity, and inclusion (DEI)</strong> practices across government, education, and the private sector. <ul><li>Reformed higher education by ending race-based discrimination in admissions and employment, DEI programming, and antisemitism.</li></ul><ul><li>Secured historic settlements of hundreds of millions with elite universities for their DEI practices, including <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2025/07/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-secures-major-settlement-with-columbia-university/\">Columbia</a>, <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2025/07/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-secures-major-settlement-with-brown-university/\">Brown</a>, <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2025/11/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-secures-major-settlement-with-cornell-university/\">Cornell</a>, the <a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/opa/pr/justice-department-announces-agreement-university-virginia-0\">University of Virginia</a>, <a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/opa/pr/united-states-announces-agreement-northwestern-university\">Northwestern</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/opa/pr/justice-department-announces-settlement-ending-antisemitism-and-race-discrimination-unc\">the University of North Carolina</a>.</li></ul><ul><li>Restored equal treatment and equal opportunity under the law by <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2025/04/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-signs-landmark-order-to-restore-equality-of-opportunity-and-meritocracy/\">eliminating</a> race-based policies and practices to rebalance outcomes along racial lines.</li></ul>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/opa/pr/doj-secures-agreements-nyu-and-upmc-end-pediatric-gender-affirming-care\">Secured deals</a> with six major hospital systems to end their transgender mutilization of minors, protecting America’s children.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2115145257469780051?a=EPW5K_MGaFEmW0oojI4&amp;s=20\"><strong>Spearheaded</strong></a><strong> a nuclear energy renaissance and </strong><a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/business/energy/once-an-arab-oil-embargo-victim-us-becomes-worlds-top-oil-exporter-2026-06-11/\"><strong>restored</strong></a><strong> America’s position as the world’s leading oil producer and exporter. </strong><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2025/05/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-directs-reform-of-the-nuclear-regulatory-commission/\">Revolutionized and time-bound</a> the nuclear regulatory process.Enabled four new advanced reactors to <a href=\"https://www.energy.gov/articles/fact-sheet-golden-era-american-nuclear-energy-has-arrived\">reach</a> criticality by July 4th, 2026. Today, a total of five have <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-06/us-says-oklo-s-small-nuclear-reactor-reaches-criticality?srnd=homepage-americas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">achieved criticality</a> following President Trump’s historic Executive Orders.<a href=\"https://www.nrc.gov/sites/default/files/cdn/doc-collection-news/2025/25-071.pdf\">Completed</a> more than 700 nuclear-energy licensing actions that will supply Americans with tens of thousands of megawatts in energy.</li></ul>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2026/08/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-announces-historic-oil-agreement-to-secure-american-energy-dominance-and-drive-venezuelas-economic-recovery/\">Delivered</a> the largest oil deal in the history of the world to secure America’s energy future.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Enacted President Trump’s record-shattering deregulation agenda, </strong><a href=\"https://news.bloomberglaw.com/environment-and-energy/trump-push-to-slash-regulatory-red-tape-opens-a-crucial-chapter\">saving</a> a family of four over $17,500—or $1.5 trillion total—in one year alone by <a href=\"https://news.bloomberglaw.com/environment-and-energy/trump-push-to-slash-regulatory-red-tape-opens-a-crucial-chapter\">cutting</a> over 400 regulations.\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Thanks to these cuts, the Trump Administration is the first in history to reduce the regulatory burden on the American people.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With more than two years to go, President Trump will not hesitate to use the power and authority of the Executive Branch to deliver historic victories for the American people.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/trump-administration-delivers-record-setting-results-through-executive-action/\">Trump Administration Delivers Record-Setting Results Through Executive Action</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
